A foodless atheist must never, ever become stressed.

I allowed Ciompi117 to be stressed for just a couple moves here and 
there to shuffle inventory.  It was a mistake.

Being burdened "just" slows you down, so that what you could have done 
in 10 moves takes you 13 or 14.

Being stressed also makes you hungrier, so that what would have taken
10 moves takes the hunger equivalent of 220 moves!
(Assuming slow digestion, of course.)

So Ciompi117 just got hungry around T:6500, instead of the expected
T:7500.  I'm in the mines at Xp level 9.  At T:9500 I will start to 
faint.  I think I am moving way too slow.  

Luckily I have found many cheap potions.  If I get the wine cellar 
mine's end that's another 2500 turns or so of life right there.

Meanwhile, I'm a bit worried about holy water.  I'll need it for 
the PYEC and to bless my magic lamp to get a horn of plenty;
and I've also discovered that lycanthropy is very, very bad for the 
foodless atheist.

